hook-redactor src/patterns.rs: client_secret_matches_snake_case.
The Rust value group \S{8,} includes the closing quote; Go stops at the closing
quote that matches the opening one (#84), so the quotes stay.
-- input --
client_secret: "S3cretPwd!Long"
-- must_contain --
<redacted:api_key>
-- must_not_contain --
S3cretPwd
-- want --
client_secret: "<redacted:api_key>"
-- deviation --
prefix
